### [Architecture Refactor]
Restructuring the frontend to separate page definitions from UI implementation.

#### [MOVE] [components](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/frontend/components) -> [src/components](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components)
- Consolidating all UI components inside the `src` folder.
- Organizing components by feature (e.g., `src/components/auth`, `src/components/layout`).

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/globals.css)
